  "description": "Single storey front extension incoporating porch; Single and\ntwo storey side to rear extension; Single storey rear extension; Alterations to roof to form\nrear dormer with Juliette balcony; Rooflights in front and side roof slopes; Solar Panels; External\nalterations (Demolition of attached garage, side and part rear extensions)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
